# Sort Rooms by Unread & Timestamp, Room Card Updates, Room Meta WS Wiring, and Toast Adjustments

This implementation plan details the changes required to:
1. Store `latestMessageTimeStamp` in IndexedDB along with unread counts and sort rooms across all tabs (`JoinedRoomsPage`, `RoomDiscovery`) primary by unread count and secondarily by timestamp.
2. Update `RoomCard` to display the typing indicator exclusively beside the room name (removing duplicate typing indicators).
3. Rearrange `RoomOptionsPage`: move the Disable Room button to the bottom alongside Leave Room, and add an "Edit Details" button at the top to allow updating room name and description.
4. Emit and capture global WebSocket events (`room_updated`) for room metadata changes so all clients update room details in real time.
5. Silence socket reconnection/reconnected toast notifications and set the global `<Toaster>` position to `top-center`.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - `latestMessageTimeStamp` will be stored in IndexedDB under the existing `unread-counts` store object schema `{ roomId, count, latestMessageTimeStamp }`.
> - Reconnection toasts (`Connection lost. Reconnecting...` / `Reconnected`) will be removed for silent background reconnection.
> - Toast notification container position will be shifted from `bottom-right` to `top-center` across the entire application.

